Keep a shared tokens as an empty list of text.
Place "2" into tokens.
Place "1" into tokens.
Place "+" into tokens.
Place "3" into tokens.
Place "*" into tokens.
Keep a shared current as empty text.
Keep a shared value as 0.
To read from spot (a whole number) with last (a whole number).
If spot is more than last, return.
The digit is the digit value of character spot of current.
Set value to value times 10 plus digit.
Read from spot plus 1 with last.

The stack is an empty list of whole numbers.
The depth is 0.
The left is 0.
The right is 0.
The result is 0.
For each token in tokens.
Set current to a copy of token.
The sign is 1.
The start is 0.
If character 0 of current is "-", set sign to -1, set start to 1.
Set value to 0.
The lastchar is the last position of current.
Read from start with lastchar.
Set value to value times sign.
The symbol is character 0 of current.
If symbol is "+", set right to item (depth minus 1) of stack, remove the last item from stack, subtract 1 from depth, set left to item (depth minus 1) of stack, remove the last item from stack, subtract 1 from depth, set result to left plus right, Place result into stack, add 1 to depth.
If symbol is "-", set right to item (depth minus 1) of stack, remove the last item from stack, subtract 1 from depth, set left to item (depth minus 1) of stack, remove the last item from stack, subtract 1 from depth, set result to left minus right, Place result into stack, add 1 to depth.
If symbol is "*", set right to item (depth minus 1) of stack, remove the last item from stack, subtract 1 from depth, set left to item (depth minus 1) of stack, remove the last item from stack, subtract 1 from depth, set result to left times right, Place result into stack, add 1 to depth.
If symbol is "/", set right to item (depth minus 1) of stack, remove the last item from stack, subtract 1 from depth, set left to item (depth minus 1) of stack, remove the last item from stack, subtract 1 from depth, set result to left divided by right, Place result into stack, add 1 to depth.
If symbol is between "0" and "9", Place value into stack, add 1 to depth.

Show item 0 of stack.
